Description: Provides useful tools for the analysis of empirical data (plot themes for publication-ready plots using R's ggplot, outlier detection using a Tukey criterion, helper function for running regression analyses with cross-validation etc.). Maintained by the work group of Prof. Dr. Daniel Oberfeld-Twistel at Johannes Gutenberg-Universitaet Mainz (https://www.staff.uni-mainz.de/oberfeld/).
